Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 09:55:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] RecoTICL/Interpretation: study-only hypothesis dump
 (dumpHypotheses)

Flat products of the hypotheses with their model features, weights and acceptance, the claimed layer clusters and the photon-winner flag of each neutral, for the training of the interpretation models. Not for the PR series.
---
 .../plugins/TICLInterpretationProducer.cc     | 119 +++++++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 115 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

